      },
      {
        "text": "When Congress spends more than it collects in revenue, Treasury bills are sold to the Federal Reserve.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "An increase in the money supply leads to economic devaluation over time.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
