    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "You know, I think right now we're doing pretty well, actually. I mean, even with all of the indictments and everything, I think the Democrats have so overreached on this idea of keeping Trump on the ballot. that they've made themselves look ridiculous. I mean, they're all over CNN every day, crying, democracy, democracy, Trump will destroy democracy. The only way we can save democracy is by Oat. not allowing people to democratically vote for their choice if they want to vote for trump i mean it's it's insane and i think most people think it is and i think even the independence this way our elections are looking at that and saying banning somebody from the ballot that's not democratic so i i think they've overreached and all of the polls look michigan at a poll they had trump up eight points in michigan that's a state if he wins michigan probably we can win again so uh... you know we'll see what happens with this but uh... you know i think the democrats have over reached in right now on by is quite unpopular as policies are quite unpopular and frankly his his frailness and inability to sort of put a sentence together or stay awake through most of the uh... activities is doing is a problem for them",
